# Everything runs on Linux (devcontainer, Codespaces, CI). CRLF in a shell
# script or a Dockerfile breaks it there, so always check out LF.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.sh text eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.tf text eol=lf
Dockerfile* text eol=lf
Taskfile.yml text eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gif binary
*.zip binary
